@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 19
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 215
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 65
hide circle
hide empty members
package "方案、诊断来源与版本历史" as T {
' @reference patient
class "患者" as patient_t <<entity>>
' @reference visit
class "就诊" as visit_t <<entity>>
class "治疗方案" as treatment_plan <<entity>> {
 治疗目标、建立时间
 进行中／已完成／已终止
 责任牙医、结束时间及原因
 --
 +建立方案(患者与目标)
 +核对方案患者归属()
}
class "方案版本" as plan_version <<entity>> {
 版本号、诊断依据
 预计安排、变更原因
 说明牙医、时间及依据
 版本状态、停止时间及原因
 --
 +核对诊断与明细完整性()
 +提交患者确认()
 +建立修订版(原版本与原因)
 +停止本版后续执行(依据)
}
patient_t "1" -- "0..*" treatment_plan
treatment_plan "1" *-- "1..*" plan_version
visit_t "0..1" -- "0..*" plan_version
' @reference plan_version
class "方案版本" as previous_plan_version <<entity>>
previous_plan_version "前版\n0..1" -- "0..*" plan_version
note bottom of plan_version
实质变更建立新版并重新说明确认。
停止旧版仅影响后续，保留既有执行。
方案估算与预计安排不产生实际应收。
end note
}
@enduml
